there's one type of bonding
we covered but I didn't

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:04.745
put the stats up on the column.

00:01:04.745 --> 00:01:08.683
So I just wanted to kind of
make sure that we finish that,

00:01:08.683 --> 00:01:10.885
and that was hydrogen bonding.

00:01:10.885 --> 00:01:12.420
And there's a little video--

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:15.023
you know, water,
we're not going to go

00:01:15.023 --> 00:01:17.125
into all the amazing
properties of water.

00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:19.828
But if you're interested,
this is a really cool website

00:01:19.828 --> 00:01:23.064
that talks about all
